| PatternFusionPass 类 | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0257.html |
| REG_FUSION_PASS 注册宏 | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0683.html |
| DecomposePass 类 | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0237.html |
| REG_DECOMPOSE_PASS 注册宏 | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0684.html |
| EsGraphBuilder 图构建器 | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0462.html |
| ES接口（总览） | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0404.html |
| CaptureTensor | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0212.html |
| MatchResult 匹配结果类 | https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/910beta1/API/ascendgraphapi/atlasgeapi_07_0199.html |
